"There is a large selection of colorful papers, ribbons, bows, and small stuffed animals to finish the job with. First, he wraps the stems with newspaper, which will hold moisture in to keep the flowers fresh until they are transferred into a vase. Then the arrangement is bound with more decorative papers and cellophane. Finally, it is tied with a beautiful ribbon. It is now ready for a patiently waiting customer.": "2aa2668df6b4",
