"“A couple of times,” Connie replied. “Why do you ask?”": "003e588f356a",
"“Actually, it’s not that bad, but a car isn’t the best way to see Tienwei anyway,” Connie informed her friend. “There are just too many pedestrians, bicycles and cars on the narrow streets. It would take forever to get anywhere in a car.”": "6a49e9dd7565",
"“Afraid you might lose, Jerry?” Harry, the smaller of the two yapped. “Or maybe you’re just chicken.”": "d353aaf10a5c",
"“Anyway, thanks for your help, Connie. I don’t know what I’d do without you,” Michelle admitted.": "8fc3e0ae40d0",
"“But my parents are kind of old and don’t like to walk too far,” Michelle said with a hint of worry in her voice.": "4ef5b04d17e4",
"“Great! Do I need to phone ahead to reserve one or can I just show up?” Michelle continued with her inquiry.": "1a2e3e8de1db",
"“Have you ever been to Tienwei?” Michelle asked her friend Connie.": "72d409917a3f",
"“How do you become a gymnast?” one of her friends, Betty, asked.": "900bd36a8089",
"“I haven’t made up my mind yet, but I’m leaning towards the balance beam.” Becky paused then added, “Or maybe the uneven bars.”": "e8e1e4bce656",
"“I wish I could take you home with me,” Susan said empathically, but she knew that it wasn’t an option.": "662ad38cdff3",
"“If it were me, I would park just off the main road and walk,” Connie suggested.": "76cfb971e3fd",
"“If worse comes to worse, I can always tackle some old people and highjack their bike,” Michelle joked, barely able to contain her laughter.": "df86433e330e",
"“Is it hard to find your way around?” Michelle inquired.": "4b5f9a0e7f75",
"“I’m not really sure,” Becky responded, “but I think you have to go to a special school.”": "ce33325c1869",
"“Just show up. There are several places that rent bikes, so it shouldn’t be a problem,” Connie told her.": "de745d8effca",
