"“Look out!” he exclaimed when he saw the falling branch.": "de2ff733b21d",
"“No problem,” Connie replied. “Anytime.”": "df1321d73ac8",
"“No, I’m dead serious,” Connie assured her. “And the multi-seated bikes have pedals for everyone. No one gets a free ride; everybody has to pull their own weight.”": "6004ff6b5752",
"“Of course it is,” her friend laughed. “It’s Taiwan. Every place is hard to get around in.”": "dceaf648ed22",
"“Tell me more,” Michelle politely demanded.": "123d06bcdd60",
"“That’s a good idea,” Connie admitted. “I took my grandparents there last year and they really enjoyed it.”": "395c5cb147cc",
"“That’s not what I wanted to hear,” Michelle confessed. “I don’t like driving at the best of times, let alone somewhere I’ve never been. I’m bound to get lost.”": "8e3689ee44fd",
"“Then Tienwei is perfect!” Connie exclaimed. “You can rent all kinds of neat bikes there.”": "47d7753f8754",
"“They have regular bikes, of course, but they also have two seated bicycles, 3-seaters and even 4-seaters,” Connie informed her.": "317e855b3e46",
"“Well I was thinking about going there this weekend,” Michelle explained. “My parents are coming for a visit and I thought they might like to look at all the flowers there.”": "2f29a14be989",
"“Well…” Dana, who was not only the oldest but also the wisest of the three, spoke candidly, “You had better make up your mind soon. You are already middle-aged for a gymnast. In China, you’d be washed-up and thrown into an old folk’s home by now.”": "62f0c84fc313",
"“What do you suggest?” Michelle asked.": "39811d91c73b",
"“What will you specialize in?” Dana, her oldest friend, inquired.": "2c8c5536a83e",
"“When I grow up, I want to be a gymnast,” a young girl named Becky declared to her friends.": "b6153f0c98e1",
"“You’re pulling my leg, aren’t you?” Michelle said.": "26f1281c347f",
"“You’re such a wimp,” Harry remarked. “My grandma could kick your butt!”": "fb5976eba341"
